        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Peak Performance</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47036.webp" alt="Peak Performance" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>[vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Keep Tinny Fit&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][ultimate_spacer height=&#8221;15&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h4>Tinny helps strengthen nonprofits through <strong>Workshops</strong>, <strong>Competitive Grants</strong>, <strong>Youth Philanthropy</strong>, and the <strong>Tin Cup Challenge</strong>. Keep Tinny in peak performance with a <strong>direct gift</strong> to the <strong>Community Foundation of Teton Valley</strong>.</h4>
<p>[/vc_column_text][dt_button link=&#8221;https://cfjh.iphiview.com/cfjh/DonorView/AccountInformation/tabid/495/dispatch/accountselection_id$10906_hash$1c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2/Default.aspx&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; bg_color_style=&#8221;custom&#8221; bg_color=&#8221;#b22d29&#8243;]Donate Today![/dt_button][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7742&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7743&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3><strong>Nonprofit Workshops</strong></h3>
<p>Workshops offer a unique opportunity for both<strong> Board &amp; staff</strong> members to engage in <strong>nonprofit best practices</strong> as a group. In addition to continuing education, workshops offer <strong>nonprofit leaders</strong> the possibility of <strong>networking</strong>, <strong>solving problems</strong>, and <strong>collaborating</strong>. In 2018, we hosted <strong>9 workshops</strong> with <strong>30 hours of training</strong> to <strong>34 organizations</strong>. We had <strong>50 Board</strong> attendees &amp; <strong>48 staff</strong> attendees.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7744&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3>Competitive Grant Program</h3>
<p>The need for local competitive grants is easily seen when considering this year&#8217;s <strong>35 applicants</strong> asking for a total of <strong>$130K</strong>. The Community Foundation, through careful vetting, was able to fund <strong>16 local projects</strong> with a total of <strong>$51K</strong> from the 2018 Tin Cup <strong>Challenger Fund</strong>.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7745&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3>Youth Philanthropy Program</h3>
<p><strong>77 students</strong> participated in last year&#8217;s Youth Philanthropy Program, funding a total of <strong>13 projects</strong> with <strong>$10,000</strong> in Grant Awards. This program educates graduating seniors about our <strong>nonprofit community</strong> and the <strong>grant-making</strong> process while instilling the idea of <strong>philanthropy</strong> in our local youth and <strong>helping local organizations</strong>.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7747&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_column_text]</p>
<h3>Tin Cup Challenge Program</h3>
<p><strong>47 nonprofits</strong> are participating in this year&#8217;s Tin Cup Challenge. The <strong>unrestricted &amp; Matching</strong> <strong>funds</strong> raised during the <strong>8-week giving period</strong> provide <strong>crucial funding</strong> for most participants. That funds must be spent within <strong>18 months</strong> helps drive the missions of our nonprofits for the benefit of the people, wildlife, and landscape of Teton Valley.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][dt_fancy_title title=&#8221;Community Counts!&#8221; title_size=&#8221;h3&#8243; title_color=&#8221;title&#8221; separator_style=&#8221;disabled&#8221;][ultimate_spacer height=&#8221;15&#8243;][vc_column_text]Not only does Tinny keep these <strong>vital nonprofit programs</strong> flourishing for the benefit of all, he&#8217;s also a trusted <strong>confidant and coach</strong> for nonprofit leaders to lean on when necessary. Consider a <strong>direct gift</strong> to the <strong>Community Foundation</strong> to support Tinny&#8217;s unwavering efforts to <strong>elevate our nonprofit community</strong> from the inside-out.[/vc_column_text][dt_button link=&#8221;https://cfjh.iphiview.com/cfjh/DonorView/AccountInformation/tabid/495/dispatch/accountselection_id$10906_hash$1c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2/Default.aspx&#8221; button_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; bg_color_style=&#8221;custom&#8221; bg_color=&#8221;#b22d29&#8243;]Donate Now![/dt_button][/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1/2&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7695&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]</p>
<h4><strong><span>Giving Period ends Friday, July 26th at 5 PM.</span></strong></h4>
<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_separator][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_single_image image=&#8221;7748&#8243; img_size=&#8221;150&#215;100&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; onclick=&#8221;custom_link&#8221; link=&#8221;https://cftetonvalley.org&#8221;][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>
